  "id": "modeling-validation-leakage",
  "title": "過学習・検証・データ漏えい",
  "topic": "データ分析",
  "summary": "予測時点と対象に合わせてデータを分け、漏えいを防ぎます。",
  "created_at": "2026-10-31",
  "base_duration_ms": 680,
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "scikit-learn：Common pitfalls",
